<title>USA: National Diagnostics deal to boost revs.</title>
<headline>National Diagnostics deal to boost revs.</headline>
<dateline>BRANDON, Fla. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Diagnostics Inc received a contract from the University of Florida's Department of Radiology for university use of its outpatient radiology facilities.</p>
<p>National Diagnostics said in a statement that the contract could increase revenues by 10 percent to as much as 20 percent annually, while putting its Jacksonville facilities &quot;on a fast pace to profitability.&quot;</p>
<p>In 1996, the company reported a loss of $835,058, or $0.44 a share, on revenues of $6.23 million.</p>
</text>
